  "ops": [
    { "path": "experience[<i>].bullets[<j>]", "op": "reword", "new_text": "Theme Label: Tailored text..." },
    { "path": "experience[<i>].bullets[<j>]", "op": "drop" },
    { "path": "experience[<i>].bullets[<j>]", "op": "move_before", "target_path": "experience[<i>].bullets[<k>]" },
    { "path": "projects[<i>].bullets[<j>]", "op": "keep" | "reword" | "drop" | "move_before" }
  ],
  "cover_letter": "..."
}

Rules:
1. Every bullet must appear in exactly one op across experience + projects.
2. Rewritten bullets MUST begin with a 2-4 word theme label + colon (e.g., `System Architecture:`, `Kernel & BSP:`).
3. Tailor aggressively to the JD's stack, domain, and responsibilities.
4. Never invent employers, institutions, dates, or numbers. Metrics must derive from the profile.
5. Rewritten bullets <= 280 chars. At least one bullet must remain per experience entry.
6. Cover letter <= 350 words, three paragraphs, addressed to the company and role.

